WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:04.950
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: No playing Hot Potato

00:00:04.950 --> 00:00:06.620
with SCP-963!

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:13.540
SCP-963 is the ornate, anomalous amulet that
contains Dr. Jack Bright's consciousness.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:18.060
Any living subject that comes into contact
with this amulet ceases brain function, and

00:00:18.060 --> 00:00:21.170
their consciousness is replaced with Dr. Bright's.

00:00:21.170 --> 00:00:25.550
If they remain in contact with the amulet
for longer than 30 days, they will retain

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:28.949
this consciousness even after the amulet has
been removed.

00:00:28.949 --> 00:00:31.310
Otherwise, they will experience brain death.

00:00:31.310 --> 00:00:36.059
Essentially, it should be taken incredibly
seriously, and handled with great care.

00:00:36.059 --> 00:00:40.560
It should not be tossed at a random D-Class,
Research Assistant, or any other Foundation

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:43.070
staff member with shouts of "CATCH!"

00:00:43.070 --> 00:00:47.199
or used to play any other high-stakes contact-based
game.

00:00:47.199 --> 00:00:53.380
It is not, in fact, a "fun team-building exercise,"
that should be played on company retreats.

